{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13103100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13103100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1310310001:1":{"text":"This way.","source_cn":"亲爱的，请走这里呦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DA66215C3419267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310310002:1":{"text":"This path seems to lead to the basement. Is the event down there?","source_cn":"这里好像通往地下室……这个项目是在地下举办的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59B251CED3A8EAC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310310003:1":{"text":"Of course! Where else would it be as dark and quiet as midnight?","source_cn":"当然啦，亲爱的。只有地下才能随时都像深夜般漆黑无光、寂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07A72697E274BD6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310310004:1":{"text":"Imagine this: pitch-black surroundings, then suddenly, a flicker of green flame... and in the shadows, someone's watching. Silent. Unseen.","source_cn":"想想看，在这样的环境里，你的眼前突然出现了一朵绿色的火...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA3785ED36CF8CA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310310005:1":{"text":"That's terrifying! Um, no, Chippy c-can't wait...","source_cn":"哇！听起来好可怕……不，不可怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0171092E61E0B267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310310006:1":{"text":"Haha! Don't worry, this activity's perfect for a brave little adventurer like you. Here, take this rulebook. Once you're ready, head to the preparation area.","source_cn":"哈哈，当然，这样的项目正适合勇敢的仓鼠先生。喏，这是“...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D407F12C36ABA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310310007:1":{"text":"First one to escape wins a petal!","source_cn":"第一位走出密室的朋友就是赢家，能得到一枚花瓣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05A0BE5D34F3801A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"Gerda","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}